  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e05-scene-14",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "まだまだこれからだよ  (We're Just Getting Started)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "student": "生徒"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the finale of Episode Five, Muranishi welcomes a packed house of cheering fans as his actresses dazzle onstage, raising the full seven million yen—only for a devastating betrayal to await him back at the studio.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせいたしました！お待たせしすぎたかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "昭和のエロ事師、村西とおるでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本日ですね、ステージと客席が大変近くなっております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうか押し合わずにご堪能いただければと思います。さあ、早速参りましょう！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "一列でお並びください！一万円ですよ、一万円をご用意くださいませ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ぜひ見ていって！どんどん配れ、もっと声出せ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "まもなく始まりますよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "社長！七百万いきました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これで二億五千万です。あとは頼んだぞ、行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "じゃあ車止めておきますね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "村西さん、お疲れさまでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ。まだまだこれからだよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせいたしました！お待たせしすぎたかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for waiting! Perhaps I have kept you waiting far too long!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "昭和のエロ事師、村西とおるでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Toru Muranishi, master purveyor of Showa-era erotica!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本日ですね、ステージと客席が大変近くなっております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight, the stage and audience seats are remarkably close together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうか押し合わずにご堪能いただければと思います。さあ、早速参りましょう！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please enjoy the show to your heart's content without pushing. Now let's begin!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "一列でお並びください！一万円ですよ、一万円をご用意くださいませ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please line up in a single file! Admission is ten thousand yen—have your ten thousand ready!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ぜひ見ていって！どんどん配れ、もっと声出せ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come see the show! Keep handing out flyers—shout louder!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "まもなく始まりますよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The next show is about to begin!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "社長！七百万いきました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss! Ticket sales just hit seven million yen!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これで二億五千万です。あとは頼んだぞ、行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That gives us our full 250 million! Take care of the rest here—let's go!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "じゃあ車止めておきますね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll go park the car, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "村西さん、お疲れさまでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, thank you for all your hard work tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ。まだまだこれからだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah. We're only just getting started.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせいたしました！お待たせしすぎたかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.5
